E. Notes / remaining gaps
--------------------------------------------------------------------
- Transitive npm packages (lockfile ~431 with license fields) are not each
  inlined here; production direct deps above are. A future release may vendor
  a machine-generated third-party report for the full lock closure.
- psycopg-binary may ship additional native libraries; consult the wheel
  metadata for the exact build you distribute.
- favicon.svg provenance remains “local SVG without upstream notice” per B7
  license progress; replace or document before asserting full resource audit.
- Root `theme/` is included for historical packaging completeness; current
  frontend consumers were documented as absent at extraction time.

- Optional private bridges (`beszel_client`, `backup_pay`) are not shipped.
  Call sites either lazy-import or fail closed with a clear RuntimeError when
  those bridges are absent; public runs should inject snapshots / skip Pay.

